Subject: [PATCH 1/3] ml/classifier: leak-free group splits, split manifest,
 held-out metrics, label audit tools

- splits.py: group by source image (filename + mirror-invariant dHash, union-find), stratified group split, val/test real-only, synthetics of eval groups dropped
- metrics.py: per-class P/R, confusion matrix, macro-F1, ECE
- train.py: checkpoint by val macro-F1, test split evaluated once, writes eval_report.json and split_manifest.json
- audit.py: table_intact review CSV, label conflicts, confident-wrong; fixes recorded via --overrides CSV
- labels.py: torch-free label vocab; dataset.py keeps the Dataset only
- tests: 23 cases
